## What alpha owns

| Kind                           | Name                                                    | Declared at                                                                   |
| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Postgres table                 | `AlphaItem` (`alpha_item`)                              | `process/src/repositories/prisma/prisma.alpha-item.repository.ts:20`          |
| Postgres, accessed not claimed | `GammaThing`                                            | `process/src/repositories/prisma/prisma.alpha-item.repository.ts:9`           |
| ClickHouse table (writes)      | `alpha_events`                                          | `process/src/repositories/clickhouse/clickhouse.alpha-event.repository.ts:31` |
| Stores required                | prisma, clickhouse                                      | `process/src/repositories/prisma/prisma.alpha.repositories.ts:7`              |
| Secrets                        | `signingKey` (ALPHA_SIGNING_KEY)                        | `process/src/app/alpha.app.ts:14`                                             |
| Config                         | `region` (ALPHA_REGION), `limits` (≈ `computeLimits()`) | `contract/src/alpha.config.ts:3`                                              |

Anything else alpha needs belongs to another module and is reached through its `*Api`.

